{"questions":[{"id":"Q070","typeId":"天平比例","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S04:p1","S06:p2","S07:p2"],"prompt":"天平上5個同款黑球與3個同款白球等重。左盤放20個黑球，右盤要放幾個白球才平衡？","answer":"12","explanation":"兩邊數量同乘4，白球需12個。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"100/3","misconception":"將5黑球對3白球的比例方向倒置，算成20×5/3。"},{"id":"c2","text":"12"},{"id":"c3","text":"4","misconception":"只算出20個黑球是5個的4倍，未再乘白球數3。"},{"id":"c4","text":"20","misconception":"錯認黑球與白球每顆同重，未使用天平給的5對3比例。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q077","typeId":"數量倍差","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S10:p1","S11:p1","S12:p1","S16:p1","S18:p1"],"prompt":"某感測值的4倍加17，等於它的2倍加43。原感測值是多少？","answer":"13","explanation":"4x+17＝2x+43，2x＝26。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"4*x+17=2*x+43","root":"13","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"13"},{"id":"c2","text":"-13","misconception":"把43−17的順序顛倒；正確應有2x＝26，感測值為正。"},{"id":"c3","text":"30","misconception":"把常數17移項時仍用加法；應先算43−17，再除以4−2。"},{"id":"c4","text":"26","misconception":"只算出兩邊常數差；還須除以未知數係數差4−2。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q078","typeId":"兩數和差","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S13:p2","S18:p1"],"prompt":"芷晴與柏宇的身高合計326公分，芷晴比柏宇高14公分。芷晴身高多少公分？","answer":"170","explanation":"設柏宇x公分，2x+14＝326，芷晴＝156+14。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"2*x+14=326","root":"156","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"177","misconception":"先將326平分再加完整14；應先扣除差值後分配，或平均數加7。"},{"id":"c2","text":"170"},{"id":"c3","text":"156","misconception":"這是柏宇的身高；題目問較高的芷晴，須再加14。"},{"id":"c4","text":"163","misconception":"直接把總身高平分，忽略兩人有14公分的身高差。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q096","typeId":"單價倍數","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S03:p1","S10:p1","S18:p1"],"prompt":"大型濾芯單價是小型的4倍，買3個大型及5個小型共680元。大型一個多少元？","answer":"160","explanation":"設小型x，12x+5x＝680，x＝40，大型160。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"3*4*x+5*x=680","root":"40","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"87.5","misconception":"把大型是小型4倍誤讀為多4元；倍數關係不能改成加法。"},{"id":"c2","text":"40","misconception":"這是小型濾芯單價；大型單價還要乘4。"},{"id":"c3","text":"85","misconception":"只以8個濾芯平均總價，忽略兩種單價相差4倍。"},{"id":"c4","text":"160"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q098","typeId":"預算買物","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S10:p1","S13:p1"],"prompt":"子霖的預算可買16個同價零件；若只買11個便剩下85元。他原有多少元？","answer":"272","explanation":"每個85÷5＝17元，預算16×17＝272。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"(16-11)*x=85","root":"17","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"187","misconception":"只算買11個的花費，原預算還包括剩下的85元。"},{"id":"c2","text":"272"},{"id":"c3","text":"17","misconception":"只求得每個零件單價；原預算要乘上可買的16個。"},{"id":"c4","text":"1360/11","misconception":"把剩85元除以11個；85元對應少買的5個零件。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q116","typeId":"折扣反推定價","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S18:p1","S10:p1"],"prompt":"一副觀測鏡打八折售出，售價1920元。原定價多少元？","answer":"2400","explanation":"0.8x＝1920，得x＝2400。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"0.8*x=1920","root":"2400","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"9600","misconception":"把八折誤當成只付20%；八折代表付原價的80%。"},{"id":"c2","text":"1536","misconception":"用1920再乘0.8是再打一次折；求定價應除以0.8。"},{"id":"c3","text":"2304","misconception":"用售價加20%還原，基準錯誤；折扣率是相對原定價。"},{"id":"c4","text":"2400"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q133","typeId":"訂閱方案比較","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S01:p2","S01:p4"],"prompt":"資料列印每份60元，付訂閱費120元後每份七折。若只印5份，下列哪一組方案比較及總費用完全正確？","answer":"單買","explanation":"單買300元，訂閱120+5×42＝330元。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"單買較省；單買300元，訂閱330元"},{"id":"c2","text":"兩者同價；單買與訂閱都300元","misconception":"誤把120元訂閱費平均每份24元當成折扣省額；每份實際只省18元。"},{"id":"c3","text":"單買較省；單買300元，訂閱420元","misconception":"訂閱後每份七折是42元，不能仍以60元加訂閱費。"},{"id":"c4","text":"訂閱較省；單買300元，訂閱210元","misconception":"只計七折列印費5×42，漏掉120元訂閱費。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q136","typeId":"固定費加件數","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S03:p1","S14:p4","S14:p6","S14:p7"],"prompt":"沖印工作室基本費90元，每張照片6元，全部八折後收240元。沖印幾張？","answer":"35","explanation":"(90+6x)×0.8＝240，x＝35。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"(90+6*x)*0.8=240","root":"35","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"50","misconception":"把折扣前總額300元全當成照片費，漏扣基本費90元。"},{"id":"c2","text":"25","misconception":"忘記實收240元已經打過八折，直接列90+6x＝240。"},{"id":"c3","text":"40","misconception":"直接用實收240元除以每張6元，漏掉基本費與整筆八折。"},{"id":"c4","text":"35"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q147","typeId":"繩段身高","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p1","S02:p2","S02:p3","S02:p4","S03:p1"],"prompt":"一條纜線分成5段，每段比翊庭的身高少12公分，纜線總長690公分。翊庭身高多少公分？","answer":"150","explanation":"5(x−12)＝690，x＝150。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"5*(x-12)=690","root":"150","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"138","misconception":"這是每段纜線長度；翊庭身高比每段多12公分。"},{"id":"c2","text":"126","misconception":"把每段比身高少12反讀成身高比每段少12，增減方向相反。"},{"id":"c3","text":"150"},{"id":"c4","text":"702/5","misconception":"只把12加到纜線總長一次；每段都少12，總共需加60。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q170","typeId":"溫度線性換算","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p3"],"prompt":"實驗室自訂溫標B＝(7/4)A+18。若A＝28度，B為多少度？","answer":"67","explanation":"7/4×28+18＝49+18＝67；此為自訂溫標，不混稱攝氏華氏。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"34","misconception":"把7/4倒置成4/7；應依題目的係數乘以28。"},{"id":"c2","text":"67"},{"id":"c3","text":"49","misconception":"只算7/4乘28，漏掉溫標公式最後加18。"},{"id":"c4","text":"80.5","misconception":"先把28加18再乘7/4，改變原式先乘後加的順序。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q001-V1","typeId":"單步加減","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S09:p2","S17:p1"],"variantOf":"Q001","variantIndex":1,"prompt":"求使等式 x-2.5=5.5 成立的 x。","answer":"8","explanation":"去括號並合併同類項，得 (1)x＝8，所以 x＝8；代回原式兩邊均為 11/2。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x-2.5=5.5","root":"8","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"text":"3","misconception":"把原式中數字 2.5 的正負號誤判，解到的是錯抄後的方程式。","id":"c1"},{"text":"-3","misconception":"把原式中數字 5.5 的正負號誤判，解到的是錯抄後的方程式。","id":"c2"},{"text":"8","id":"c3"},{"text":"-8","misconception":"移項或除以係數時多改變一次正負號。","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q001-V2","typeId":"單步加減","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S09:p2","S17:p1"],"variantOf":"Q001","variantIndex":2,"prompt":"求使等式 x-3.5=6.5 成立的 x。","answer":"10","explanation":"去括號並合併同類項，得 (1)x＝10，所以 x＝10；代回原式兩邊均為 13/2。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x-3.5=6.5","root":"10","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"text":"3","misconception":"把原式中數字 3.5 的正負號誤判，解到的是錯抄後的方程式。","id":"c1"},{"text":"-3","misconception":"把原式中數字 6.5 的正負號誤判，解到的是錯抄後的方程式。","id":"c2"},{"text":"-10","misconception":"移項或除以係數時多改變一次正負號。","id":"c3"},{"text":"10","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"}]}